---
title: Security & Governance - Defense in Depth
---
flowchart TD
    CODE[Code in release/* branch]

    subgraph "Layer 1: Pipeline Triggers"
        TRIGGER{Branch filter<br/>release/* only}
    end

    subgraph "Layer 2: Pipeline Chain"
        CHAIN{deploy.yml DM<br/>must succeed}
    end

    subgraph "Layer 3: Environment Approvals"
        ENV_APPROVE{Human approval<br/>on ADO Environment}
    end

    subgraph "Layer 4: Service Connection"
        CONN_APPROVE{Approval on<br/>service connection}
        CONN_BRANCH{Branch control<br/>refs/heads/release/*}
        CONN_HOURS{Business hours<br/>check}
    end

    subgraph "Result"
        DEPLOY[Credential issued<br/>Deployment proceeds]
    end

    CODE --> TRIGGER
    TRIGGER -->|pass| CHAIN
    TRIGGER -->|fail: wrong branch| BLOCKED1[Blocked]
    CHAIN -->|pass| ENV_APPROVE
    CHAIN -->|fail: DM not passed| BLOCKED2[Blocked]
    ENV_APPROVE -->|approved| CONN_APPROVE
    ENV_APPROVE -->|rejected| BLOCKED3[Blocked]
    CONN_APPROVE -->|approved| CONN_BRANCH
    CONN_APPROVE -->|rejected| BLOCKED4[Blocked]
    CONN_BRANCH -->|pass| CONN_HOURS
    CONN_BRANCH -->|fail: wrong branch| BLOCKED5[Blocked]
    CONN_HOURS -->|in window| DEPLOY
    CONN_HOURS -->|outside hours| BLOCKED6[Queued until window]

    style DEPLOY fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#4caf50,stroke-width:2px
    style BLOCKED1 fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#f44336
    style BLOCKED2 fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#f44336
    style BLOCKED3 fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#f44336
    style BLOCKED4 fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#f44336
    style BLOCKED5 fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#f44336
    style BLOCKED6 fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#ff9800
